 "is_vocab": false,
 "stimulus_html": "You are about to roll a standard 6-sided die 20 times. Let <span data-math=\"S\">S</span>\ndenote a success, which will be rolling a number greater than 4. Find the probabilities of the following events, rounded to 4 decimal places: ",
 "questions": [
  {
   "id": 516863,
   "is_answer_order_important": false,
   "stimulus_html": "",
   "stem_html": "<span data-math=\"S \\leq 5\">S \\leq 5</span>",
   "answers": [],
   "hints": [],
   "formats": [
    "free-response"
   ],
   "combo_choices": [],
   "collaborator_solutions": [
    {
     "images": [],
     "solution_type": "summary",
     "content_html": "<p>Google Sheets can be used to compute cumulative binomial distributions. The event is sides less than or equal to 5.</p>\n<p>There are two sides greater than 4: 5 and 6. The probability is <span data-math=\"\\frac{2}{6} = \\frac{1}{3} \\approx 0.333333\"></span>.</p>\n<p>In Google Sheets, enter “=BINOMDIST(5, 20, 0.33333, TRUE)” to get your answer: 0.02972.</p>\n"
    },
    {
     "images": [],
     "solution_type": "detailed",
     "content_html": "0.2972"
    }
   ],
   "community_solutions": []
  },
  {
   "id": 516864,
   "is_answer_order_important": false,
   "stimulus_html": "",
   "stem_html": "<span data-math=\"S < 8\">S &lt;8</span>",
   "answers": [],
   "hints": [],
   "formats": [
    "free-response"
   ],
   "combo_choices": [],
   "collaborator_solutions": [
    {
     "images": [],
     "solution_type": "summary",
     "content_html": "<p>This uses the wrong inequality. Instead of S &lt; 8, you want S ≤ 7.</p>\n<p>There are two sides greater than 4: 5 and 6. The probability is <span data-math=\"\\frac{2}{6} = \\frac{1}{3} \\approx 0.333333\"></span>.</p>\n<p>In Google Sheets, enter “=BINOMDIST(7, 20, 0.33333, TRUE)” to get your answer: 0.6615.</p>\n"
    },
    {
     "images": [],
     "solution_type": "detailed",
     "content_html": "0.6615"
    }
   ],
   "community_solutions": []
  },
  {
   "id": 516865,
   "is_answer_order_important": false,
   "stimulus_html": "",
   "stem_html": "<span data-math=\"S>10\">S&gt;10</span>",
   "answers": [],
   "hints": [],
   "formats": [
    "free-response"
   ],
   "combo_choices": [],
   "collaborator_solutions": [
    {
     "images": [],
     "solution_type": "detailed",
     "content_html": "0.0919"
    }
   ],
   "community_solutions": []
  },
  {
   "id": 516866,
   "is_answer_order_important": false,
   "stimulus_html": "",
   "stem_html": "<span data-math=\"S≥7\">S≥7</span>",
   "answers": [],
   "hints": [],
   "formats": [
    "free-response"
   ],
   "combo_choices": [],
   "collaborator_solutions": [
    {
     "images": [],
     "solution_type": "summary",
     "content_html": "<p>This goes in the wrong direction, so you will use complements. First find S ≤ 6.</p>\n<p>In Google Sheets, enter “=BINOMDIST(6, 20, 0.33333, TRUE)” to get the answer.0.4793554…</p>\n<p>Your answer is <span data-math=\"1{\\text{ }}-{\\text{ }}0.4793{\\text{ }} = {\\text{ }}0.5207\"></span>.</p>\n"
    },
    {
     "images": [],
     "solution_type": "detailed",
     "content_html": "0.5207"
    }
   ],
   "community_solutions": []
  },
  {
   "id": 516867,
   "is_answer_order_important": false,
   "stimulus_html": "",
   "stem_html": "<span data-math=\"5<S<8\">5&lt;S&lt;8</span>",
   "answers": [],
   "hints": [],
   "formats": [
    "free-response"
   ],
   "combo_choices": [],
   "collaborator_solutions": [
    {
     "images": [],
     "solution_type": "summary",
     "content_html": "<p>You are looking for the outcome {6,7}.</p>\n<p>To do this, you will find S ≤ 7 and subtract S ≤ 5.</p>\n<p>In Google Sheets, enter “=BINOMDIST(7, 20, 0.33333, TRUE)” to get the answer 0.66148…</p>\n<p>In Google Sheets, enter “=BINOMDIST(5, 20, 0.33333, TRUE)” to get the answer 0.2972248…</p>\n<p>Subtract the two answers to find the chance of 5 &lt; S &lt; 8 is approximately 0.3643.</p>\n"
    },
    {
     "images": [],
     "solution_type": "detailed",
     "content_html": "0.3643"
    }
   ],
   "community_solutions": []
  }
 ],
